  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Choose one next planning step using the local decision below. Return exactly one listed statement and stop. No other planning choices have been supplied.\n{\"context\": \"A tool list can show current users and expected return times beside the storage area.\", \"decision\": \"How should shared tools move between volunteers?\", \"goal\": \"Keep routine garden work visible and shared without requiring everyone to attend at the same time.\", \"problem\": \"A small community garden has established beds, safe shared tools, a water supply, and volunteers whose availability varies. Gardening methods are already agreed; the new work is organizing participation, observations, and shared resources. Each decision below covers a distinct coordination need and can be combined with any choices at the other decisions.\"}\nCANDIDATE STATEMENTS:\nA session helper sets shared-tool time blocks on the tool list and lets volunteers claim them. A common schedule coordinates use before individual handovers occur.\nVolunteers request shared tools on the tool list, and current users agree on return times with them. Handover times respond to actual waiting users.\nVolunteers write their expected return times on the tool list before taking shared tools. Later users can plan around the announced returns."
    }
